# RPL control message samples -- PQC-Ready IoT Protocol Analyzer
# ICMPv6 RPL packets (type=0x9B) with various security configurations.

# 1. RPL DIS (DODAG Information Solicitation) -- unsecured
#    Type=0x9B Code=0x00 Checksum=0x1234
9B001234

# 2. RPL DIO -- unsecured, with DODAG base object
#    Type=0x9B Code=0x01 Checksum=0xABCD
#    DIO Base: InstanceID=1 Version=2 Rank=0x0100 (256)
#    G=1 MOP=2 Prf=0 DTSN=0 Flags=0 Reserved=0
#    DODAGID = fd00::1 (16 bytes)
9B01ABCD 01020100 90000000 FD000000 00000000 00000000 00000001

# 3. RPL Secure DIO with ECDSA-P256 -- quantum-vulnerable
#    Type=0x9B Code=0x81 (Secure DIO) Checksum=0x5678
#    Security section: level=3 algorithm=2 (ECDSA-P256) + 4 pad bytes
#    Then DIO base (24 bytes)
9B815678 03020000 00000101 01008000 0000FD00 00000000 00000000 00000000 0001

# 4. RPL Secure DIO with AES-128-CCM -- quantum-safe
#    Type=0x9B Code=0x81 Checksum=0x9ABC
#    Security section: level=5 algorithm=0 (CCM-AES-128)
9B819ABC 05000000 00000201 00809000 0000FD00 00000000 00000000 00000000 0002

# 5. RPL Secure DAO with RSA-SHA256 -- quantum-vulnerable
#    Type=0x9B Code=0x82 (Secure DAO) Checksum=0xDEF0
#    Security section: level=3 algorithm=1 (RSA-SHA256) + 4 pad bytes
#    DAO base: InstanceID=1 K=0 DAOSequence=5 Reserved=0
9B82DEF0 03010000 00000100 0500
